name: tailwind-gsap-component
description: "Generates a UI component with Tailwind CSS + GSAP animation"
variables:
  - component_name
  - theme
  - animation
prompt: |
  Create a UI component "{{component_name}}" using Tailwind CSS following the "{{theme}}" theme.
  Add GSAP animation: "{{animation}}" triggered on scroll or hover.
  Provide clean HTML, JS, and SCSS code snippets ready to integrate.
